# Deploy the live site

After any change that affects the portfolio visitors see, commit it and push to `master` on `a2105z/a2105z.github.io`. GitHub Actions deploys that branch to https://a2105z.github.io/.

- Do this in the same turn as the change. Do not leave the live site behind the local one.
- Confirm the Deploy to GitHub Pages workflow succeeds before saying the live site is updated.
- Skip the push only when the user explicitly says to keep a change local.
